arguments.description:
Choose which email addresses will be used to send a message. Possible choices:
        <ul>
            <li>primary_only (default) - user's primary email;
            <li>alt_only - user's alternative email (see method <a href='https://usosapps.vistula.edu.pl/developers/api/services/users/#user'>services/users/user</a> for details);
            <li>primary_preferred - if user doesn't have a primary email, alternative will be used;
            <li>alt_preferred - if user doesn't have an alternative email, primary will be used
        </ul>
